$MDESC::Type = "Capture the Flag";
$MDESC::Text = "<s3><f1>Mission Type: <f0> Capture the Flag" @
         "\n<f1>Planet: <f0> Avicord" @
         "\n<f1>Weather: <f0> Clear" @
         "\n<f1>Time of Day: <f0> Midday" @ 
         "\n<f1># of Teams: <f0> 2" @
         "\n\n<f1>Briefing:<f0> The rival clans <vServer::teamName0> and <vServer::teamName1> have landed on planet Avicord to do battle.  Each team must grab the other's flag and successfully bring it back to their mother ship to capture it for a point.  The ships are extremely high in the air and are well defended.  In order to win your team must make use of the elevators or the Docking Station to gain access to the enemy mother ship.  You should also make good use of the secret areas hidden all over the ships.\n\n" @
"<f1>Map by:\n" @
"<f2>Jason Robert Nelson<f0> aka <f2>[HvC]KingAmadala\n" @
"<f1>and\n" @
"<f2>Nathan Sweet<f0> aka <f2>[HvC]NaTeDoGG\n\n" @
"http://havoc.sirris.com\n";